I want to bring to your notice that Pune Municipal corporation , Pune Police and Pollution control board have not taken any action on cat owners for feces pollution issues raised violating my fundamental right to live in healthy and pollution free environment guaranteed by constitution of india article 21. pl. ensure that grievances raised to G20 President/Prime ministers office are resolved only with the national green act precautionary principle , polluter pays principle and sustainability principle.
&#160;
On the occasion of Republic Day on January 26, 2023 direct government servants to collect face pollution from my house premises for further action,investigation, disposal and direct Pune Municipal corporation, Pune Police and pollution control board to take strictect action as per law on cat owners and take necessary steps to prevent recurrence of cat feces issue inside my house premises.

